    <section class="py-16 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5 lg:px-8">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-ink mb-6">Who decides which therapeutic approach is used?</h2>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">The approach is decided together. We do not hold to a single model; we choose from CBT, psychodynamic therapy, ACT and motivational interviewing according to the subject and to you. In most processes they are combined.</p>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">The approaches are set out in more detail on our <a href="/en/our-approach.html" class="text-primary underline hover:no-underline">approach page</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 bg-warm">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5 lg:px-8">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-ink mb-6">How do sessions work?</h2>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">Across every area of work, sessions last 45 minutes and are usually weekly. Sessions can be held in English or Turkish, either in person at the centre or online over a secure video connection.</p>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">Sessions and your personal information are protected in line with confidentiality principles. We describe the process step by step on the <a href="/en/therapy-process.html" class="text-primary underline hover:no-underline">therapy process page</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

